  Kind: 1
  Label: Gate keeper's letter
  Body: 'THE MARGRAVE''S GATE


    The last steward bolted the great doors behind
    him and swore the night would not end for any of us. He was right. The sun has
    not come over the wall since.


    The drawbridge winch is behind you. Crossing
    is the only way out, and the bridge will not lower for anyone who has not read
    the Blood Ledger and survived the hunt.


    Something sleeps in the crypt.
    Do not let it find you.'
  HidePoint: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  ExitPoint: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  Door: {fileID: 0}
  Circuit: {fileID: 0}
  RelicIndex: -1
  Art: {fileID: 0}
